1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,200
Here is a beautiful puzzle.

2
00:00:02,200 --> 00:00:05,234
Two crossed Polaroids: nothing gets through.

3
00:00:05,234 --> 00:00:08,385
Now slip a third sheet between them, at an angle.

4
00:00:08,385 --> 00:00:11,692
Surely a third filter can only block more light?

